! ===== 电子碰撞反应 (Electron impact reactions) =====

! Reaction 1: 电子-H2 弹性碰撞 (Elastic collision)
e- + H2 --> e- + H2
lxcat 2.723e-04 ELASTIC.txt

! Reaction 2: 电子-H2 激发 (Excitation)
e- + H2 --> e- + H2
lxcat 0.5  EXCITATION3.txt

! Reaction 3: 电子-H2 电离 (Ionization)
e- + H2 --> e- + e- + H2+
lxcat 15.43 IONIZATION.txt

! Reaction 4: 电子-H2 解离电离 (Dissociative ionization)
e- + H2 --> e- + e- + H+ + H
lxcat 19.00 dissociativ.txt

! ===== H+ 碰撞反应 (H+ impact reactions) =====

! Reaction 5: H+-H2 电荷交换 (Charge exchange)
H+ + H2 -CEX-> H + H2+
lxcat 3.160000e+00 H2-06-IONIZATION.txt

! Reaction 6: H+-H2 激发 [自动识别产生 Hα]
H+ + H2 --> H + H2
lxcat 1.000000e+02 H2-08-EXCITATION.txt

! Reaction 7: H+-H2 弹性碰撞
H+ + H2 --> H+ + H2
lxcat 0.000000e+00 H2-10-ELASTIC.txt

! ===== H2+ 碰撞反应 (H2+ impact reactions) =====

