H2+ + H2 --> H2+ + H2
lxcat 0.000000e+00 H2plus-H2-MOMENTUM_TRANSFER.txt

! Reaction 10: H2+-H2 电荷交换
H2+ + H2 -CEX-> H2f + H2+
lxcat 0.000000e+00 H2-12-IONIZATION.txt

! Reaction 11: H2+-H2 解离电离
H2+ + H2 --> H+ + H + H2
lxcat 5.620000e+00 H2-14-IONIZATION.txt

! Reaction 12: H2+-H2 激发+解离 [自动识别产生 Hα]
H2+ + H2 --> H2+ + H + H
lxcat 7.500000e+02 H2-16-EXCITATION.txt

! Reaction 13: H2+-H2 二次电离
H2+ + H2 --> H2+ + H2+ + e-
lxcat 31.0   IONIZATION2.txt

