! Reaction 16: H3+-H2 电荷交换
H3+ + H2 --> H2f + H3+
lxcat 5.400000e+01 H2-21-IONIZATION.txt

! Reaction 17: H3+-H2 激发+解离 [自动识别产生 Hα]
H3+ + H2 --> H2+ + H2 + H
lxcat 7.500000e+01 H2-23-EXCITATION.txt

! Reaction 18: H3+-H2 弹性碰撞
H3+ + H2 --> H3+ + H2
